### 1. Analyze Intent
This test is verifying that an explicitly started Timer (using `.start()`) followed by calling `.start()` again raises a `TimerError` (since the timer already started), while also checking that calling `.start()` on a timer that was already stopped via context manager exit doesn't crash.

